{"candidateAnswer":"About 3 months","evidence":"[D17:1 | 9:49 am on 22 July, 2022] John: Hi James! I just started playing chess to get better at strategy. I'm loving it! Have you ever tried it out?\n[D30:2 | 5:20 pm on 5 November, 2022] John: Hey James! Wow, what an adventure! Lately, I've been busy with something. Guess what? I had a great accomplishment this Tuesday! It was awesome.\n[D30:4 | 5:20 pm on 5 November, 2022] John: I won the regional chess tournament. It was intense but I came out on top!","itemId":"urn:uuid:aa7f7252-5e71-561c-9e1a-125c59e67d37","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:f736fd166bbb044c8ead9104255e59db878cab4c4b1173f36954daaca7df34c4","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How long did John practice chess for before winning the chess tournament?","referenceAnswer":"nearly four months","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"f736fd166bbb044c8ead9104255e59db878cab4c4b1173f36954daaca7df34c4"}}]}